    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "This is a high degree of freedom single player battle chess game.<br />\r\nYou can pass the level by entering any teleportation gate within the level.<br />\r\nBOSS can freely choose whether to fight or not.<br />\r\nThere are various rewards for defeating bosses.<br />\r\nYou can save at the beginning of each round.<br />\r\nThe stronghold interface allows for job transfer.<br />\r\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br />\r\nAttention! If the game starts flashing, you can try running game.exe directly from the game installation directory to solve the problem.<br />\r\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br />\r\nEntering any teleportation gate allows you to pass through the current level, but rewards require defeating specific enemies to be obtained.<br />\r\n104 light attribute professions (players can transfer),<br />\r\n104 dark attribute professions,<br />\r\n----------------------------------------------------<br />\r\nBy default, there are 20 attacking characters,<br />\r\nUsing remote units and air forces can reduce the difficulty of the game,<br />\r\n------------------<br />\r\nIf you want to experience higher difficulty,<br />\r\nSo, I suggest,<br />\r\nWith only 15 people and others standing still, the game will become even more difficult,<br />\r\nWith only 10 people on standby, the game will become even more difficult,<br />\r\nWith only 5 people and others standing still, the game will become even more difficult,<br />\r\nUsing only melee army units, the game will become even more difficult,<br />\r\nYou can also choose 20 attack characters from any of the 339 available characters,<br />\r\n----------------------------------------------------<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is currently no two week list, and there may be more in the future,<br />\r\nAll levels have a teleportation gate that returns to the teleportation hall. If you cannot defeat it, you can come back to practice at any time,<br />\r\nAmong them,<br />\r\n------------------<br />\r\nEmpire 20 levels,<br />\r\n------------------<br />\r\n20 levels in the Kingdom of Mountains,<br />\r\n------------------<br />\r\nDesert Kingdom 20 levels,<br />\r\n------------------<br />\r\nIf you start to attack the Tower of Trials, it will be difficult. It is recommended to challenge around LV10,<br />\r\nYou can freely teleport between levels of the same level, such as Empire 1, Mountain Kingdom 1, Desert Kingdom 1, and Empire 1 (convenient for brushing items and experiences),<br />\r\nWhen a certain level cannot be reached, you can also switch paths,<br />\r\n------------------<br />\r\nI don't have a two-week schedule at the moment because I don't know how to make it yet,<br />\r\n----------------------------------------------------<br />\r\nGame Help:<br />\r\n1. Enter any portal to clear the level,<br />\r\nThe bottom conveyor door leads to the corresponding conveyor hall,<br />\r\n3 f4=full screen,<br />\r\n4. Equipment is very important,<br />\r\n5 different armor attributes can be stacked,<br />\r\nThe growth rates of different professions and attributes vary,<br />\r\n7 different weapons will have different growth rate bonuses,<br />\r\nThe ability of enemies with 8 dark attributes is affected by difficulty,<br />\r\n----------------------------------------------------<br />\r\nCurrently, there are a total of 106 difficulties,<br />\r\n------------------<br />\r\nNormal, with a basic experience value of 1. Normal difficulty level (capable of critical strikes) (capable of counterattacks),<br />\r\n------------------<br />\r\nNormal 1, basic experience value 1 attribute correction+1 (speed and movement not added) (can critical strike) (can counterattack),<br />\r\nOrdinary 2, basic experience value 2 attribute correction+2 (speed and movement not added) (can critical strike) (can counterattack),<br />\r\nNormal 3, basic experience value 3 attribute correction+3 (speed and movement not added) (can critical strike) (can counterattack),<br />\r\n------------------<br />\r\nDifficulty 1 to Difficulty 100 (this series is the highest difficulty),<br />\r\n------------------<br />\r\nBasic experience value 1, attribute correction+1 (without movement) (can critical strike) (can counterattack) (can attack again) (double experience) (initialization random number for reading files),<br />\r\nBasic experience value of 100, attribute correction+100 (without movement) (can critically strike) (can counterattack) (can attack again) (double experience) (initialization random number for reading files),<br />\r\n<br />\r\n----------------------------------------------------<br />\r\nThere are a total of 339 characters that players can use,<br />\r\n170 special characters with light attributes (each with different growth) (the first 20 characters are team leaders),<br />\r\n7 NPC characters with light attributes (each with different growth),<br />\r\n58 ordinary characters with light attributes (initial level 1) (initial attribute 1) (initial HP 20) (growth HP 90 strength, 60 magic 10 skills, 60 speed, 50 movement, 40 defense, 30 magic defense, 20 magic defense),<br />\r\n104 ordinary characters with dark attributes (initial level 1) (initial attribute 1) (initial HP 1) (growth HP 90 strength, 60 magic, 10 skills, 60 speed, 50 movement, 40 defense, 30 magic defense, 20 magic defense),",
